# Product size / drop subset

On the **products setting page**, subset changes follow:

- **Add** a size or drop anytime (new cells start at qty 0).
- **Remove** a size or drop only if **every cell on that size or drop has qty on hand = 0**.
- Server `saveSubset` re-applies this lock so a disabled checkbox cannot be bypassed.
- Checked boxes with stock stay checked (disabled) until inventory is zeroed.

## Future: customer orders

When customer **orders** (order tables) exist, treat **open / unshipped order qty** the same as on-hand: do not allow removing a size or drop that still has ordered units. Inventory + orders both block remove. Update `saveSubset` and the subset UI together when orders ship.
